# Native Android Review Focus

- Check for correctness regressions first
- Look for unsafe concurrency, missing cancellation, and main-thread misuse
- Verify error handling, security boundaries, and sensitive-data protection
- Check that copy and constants are centralized
- Confirm tests cover new behavior and failure paths
